    stem: "Chop Cup is a magic routine which involves three cups face down and one ball underneath one of the cups. In any single move the position of two cups can be swapped using one of three possible moves, A, B or C as shown in Figure 4 below. Figure 4 Each cup is identified by its position. Initially the leftmost cup is at position 1, the middle cup is at position 2 and the right cup is at position 3.",
