    section: "B", questionRef: "2024 HL Q13(b)(i)",
    stem: "Computer vision is a field of AI that uses machine learning techniques to develop models capable of identifying objects in an image. Study the image shown in Figure 5 and answer the questions that follow. Figure 5 Scenario 1: An online streaming service that recommends films based on users’ viewing habits. Scenario 2: An automated lawnmower that uses sensors to navigate an outdoor space and avoid obstacles while cutting the grass.",
