    stem: "You are keen to adopt a user-centred approach to the design of the system and ensure that it provides an inclusive user experience for all users. Scenario: A visually impaired user needs assistance in identifying containers and navigating the DRS application. Identify and explain two appropriate assistive technology solutions that could be used in the DRS system to enhance accessibility for this user.",
